PYTHON FOR COMPUTATIONAL PROBLEM SOLVING
Modules – Import mechanisms

Import all Names from a Module
•  * symbol with the import statement is used to import all the names from a
  module.
•  Syntax - from module_name import *
•  Example 3
  def add(x, y):
      return (x+y)
  def subtract(x, y):
      return (x-y)                                                        module3.py
  def multiply(x, y):
      return (x*y)
  def divide(x, y):
      return (x/y)
  #Assuming 'y' is never zero
